      "message": "In enqueue.c: the separate seq_cst fence followed by an acquire exchange could be folded into a single seq_cst RMW:\n\nif (!__atomic_exchange_n (\u0026qp-\u003ehdr-\u003eenq.interrupt_pending, 1, __ATOMIC_SEQ_CST))\nOn x86 the xchg is already a full barrier, so the explicit fence only adds an extra mfence on a per-frame path. On ARM a seq_cst exchange (ldaxr/stlxr or swpal) orders the preceding head store without a separate dmb. SEQ_CST includes acquire, so it still pairs with the DAQ\u0027s release store of 0.",
